{"sections":{"image_with_text_d3Q4nM":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_rQzMqX":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"L’histoire de Daewoo","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_UDK8YH":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Une marque de confiance depuis plus de 40 ans<\/strong><\/p><p>Fondée en 1971 en Corée du Sud, <strong>Daewoo<\/strong> est une marque historique reconnue mondialement dans les domaines de l’électronique, de l’automobile et des technologies grand public. Depuis sa création, Daewoo s’est illustrée par son engagement envers l’innovation, la fiabilité et la qualité de ses produits.<\/p><p>Présente dans plus de 60 pays, Daewoo est une marque qui inspire confiance et modernité. Grâce à une stratégie ambitieuse d’extension de sa licence à de nouveaux secteurs, Daewoo accompagne désormais les particuliers dans la protection de leur foyer avec des <strong>solutions de sécurité connectées<\/strong>, simples à utiliser et accessibles à tous.<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_89Cq7b":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Découvrir les alarmes","button_link":"https:\/\/daewoo-security.fr\/pages\/comparateur-am301-sa501-pa501z","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_rQzMqX","text_UDK8YH","button_89Cq7b"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMAGE_LIFESTYLE_1.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"rich_text_YjCeTf":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_39akqh":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Notre partenariat exclusif avec Daewoo","heading_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_CR9qpX":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Le site <strong>Daewoo-Security.fr<\/strong> est exploité sous <strong>licence officielle<\/strong> de la marque Daewoo. Nous avons l’honneur de proposer une gamme complète de systèmes d’alarme et de vidéosurveillance connectés, conçus pour répondre aux attentes des familles modernes : simplicité, autonomie, fiabilité.<\/p><p>Chaque produit proposé sur notre site respecte un cahier des charges strict, avec un support technique basé en France et une attention constante portée à l’expérience utilisateur.<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_39akqh","text_CR9qpX"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.name","settings":{"text_alignment":"center","text_alignment_mobile":"center","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_width":"small","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":100,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}},"image_with_text_9a3dDK":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_GiP7Ud":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Une vision tournée vers l’avenir","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_jngE4j":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Chez Daewoo Security, nous croyons que la sécurité de la maison doit être simple, intelligente et sans contrainte. C’est pourquoi tous nos systèmes sont <strong>sans abonnement<\/strong>, <strong>faciles à installer<\/strong>, et pilotables à distance via l'application gratuite <strong>Daewoo Home Connect<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Nous sommes fiers de porter les valeurs d'une marque internationale, tout en restant proches de nos clients, en leur apportant des solutions concrètes, modernes et accessibles pour protéger ce qui compte le plus.<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_R3BpUQ":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Découvrir les alarmes","button_link":"https:\/\/daewoo-security.fr\/pages\/comparateur-am301-sa501-pa501z","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_GiP7Ud","text_jngE4j","button_R3BpUQ"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Daewoo_Vigilia_-_Alarme_-_Photo_Produit_1600_x_1600_px_2.png","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"number_counter_XF6HD3":{"type":"number-counter","blocks":{"counter_GKtNbk":{"type":"counter","settings":{"title":"Daewoo Security c'est plus de 60.000 clients satisfaits et protégés !","number":"60 000","unit":"","duration":2}}},"block_order":["counter_GKtNbk"],"name":"t:sections.number-counter.name","settings":{"gap":"large","columns":1,"text_alignment":"center","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"text_alignment_mobile":"center","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"","gradient_background":"linear-gradient(360deg, rgba(12, 30, 74, 1) 7%, rgba(242, 243, 255, 1) 85%)","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false}},"image_with_text_A84RE7":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_YQjKBc":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Notre équipe","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_y9rVYz":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>C’est au coeur de nos <strong>locaux Bordelais <\/strong>que nous gérons et envoyons toutes vos commandes <strong>préparées dans le plus grand des soins<\/strong>.<br\/><br\/>Nos <strong>techniciens<\/strong> maitrisent parfaitement tous les produits de la gamme et sont capables de vous <strong>aider rapidement et efficacement <\/strong>dans l’installation de votre système de sécurité afin d’en utiliser toutes les capacités.<br\/><br\/><strong>La relation client reste donc l’élément clé de notre philosophie.<\/strong><\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_YQjKBc","text_y9rVYz"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Design_sans_titre_-_2025-03-11T154651.307.webp","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_aV4i8f":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_eP78n6":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Notre mission : vous offrir le meilleur sans mauvaise surprise","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_JRkiid":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Fondée sur des décennies d'expérience et d'innovation, Daewoo Security s'efforce continuellement d'offrir les technologies les plus avancées et les solutions de sécurité les plus efficaces sur le marché. <\/p><p>Que vous recherchiez des systèmes de surveillance de pointe, des alarmes ou appareils connectés, notre équipe d'experts est là pour vous aider à trouver la solution parfaitement adaptée à vos besoins <strong>le tout sans abonnement.<\/strong><\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_eP78n6","text_JRkiid"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Design_sans_titre_-_2025-03-11T155024.924.webp","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"image_with_text_6yFPRh":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_VJwyTC":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Notre engagement envers l'excellence","heading_size":"title-md","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_RA8BLG":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Notre engagement envers l'excellence se reflète dans chaque aspect de notre entreprise, de la qualité de nos produits à notre service clientèle exceptionnel. Nous croyons fermement en la tranquillité d'esprit, et c'est pourquoi nous travaillons sans relâche pour garantir la sécurité et la protection de nos clients et leurs proches, aujourd'hui et pour l'avenir.<\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_WXRrnG":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Découvrir les alarmes","button_link":"https:\/\/daewoo-security.fr\/pages\/comparateur-am301-sa501-pa501z","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_VJwyTC","text_RA8BLG","button_WXRrnG"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Design_sans_titre_-_2025-03-11T155337.545.webp","image_height":"650px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobil